# AI Invoice Processing Platform

An intelligent invoice processing platform built with Python, Streamlit, and PostgreSQL.

The application automates invoice extraction, validation, storage, and analysis, helping SMEs reduce manual administrative tasks and gain valuable business insights.

## Features

### Dashboard
- Total invoices
- Total invoice value
- Total VAT amount
- Total suppliers
- Recent invoice overview

### Invoice Upload
- Upload PDF invoices
- Automatic data extraction
- Invoice validation
- Duplicate detection
- Confidence scoring
- Database storage

### Invoice Management
- View all invoices
- Search and filter invoices
- View invoice details
- Track booking status

### Supplier Management
- Supplier overview
- Total invoice value per supplier
- Supplier invoice history

## Invoice Fields

The platform captures and stores:

- Supplier
- VAT Number
- Chamber of Commerce Number
- Invoice Number
- Invoice Date
- Due Date
- Currency
- Total Excluding VAT
- VAT Amount
- Total Including VAT
- VAT Code
- Category
- Ledger Account
- Booking Status
- Confidence Score

## Technology Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- PostgreSQL
- Psycopg3
- Pandas
- Plotly
- PyMuPDF (Fitz)

## Database

The application uses PostgreSQL to store invoice information.

Main table:

- invoices

Key features:

- Unique invoice numbers
- Supplier tracking
- VAT calculations
- Confidence scoring
- Invoice status management